OL,3,GNEWSAMLAs to debate bill aimed at
OL,4,Abanning conversion practices
OL,5,
OL,6,FUnionist parties are expected to oppose
OL,7,Fthe bill, but it is believed to have
OL,8,Fsupport from Sinn Fein and the Social
OL,9,FDemocratic and Labour Party (SDLP).
